window.products.push({"id":1001232,"name":"Rae Dunn Shelf Liner - Drawer Liner and Cabinet Liner - Decorative Anti-Slip Refrigerator Liners and Shelf Liners for Kitchen Cabinets, Pantry Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3TKoioIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With Rae Dunn’s signature font and design style, you can freshen up cabinets, drawers, shelves, and cupboards with ease! Our anti-slip shelf liners arrive as a continuous roll that can be cut and trimmed to the exact size you need. Reusable, washable, and ready to makeover your kitchen.PRODUCT FEATURES:Dimensions: 17.75” x 8’Anti-Slip GripTextured SurfaceEasy to Cut to SizeReusableEasily wipes cleanSPRUCE UP YOUR STORAGEProtect cabinets and shelves from moisture. Give the kitchen cupboards a redo. Guard refrigerator shelves from stains and liquid spills. Line deep drawers and wire shelving so they’re easier to clean later. Rae Dun Shelf Liner is designed to keep surfaces clean and dry for minimal mess. Using a shelf liner that is both removable and wipeable makes cleanup times faster.GIVE SHELVES & DRAWERS A FRESH STARTIt’s smart to protect your shelves and drawers with liner right from the start. But if you’re not the first person in your home, there may already be years of yuckiness left behind. Adding shelf and drawer liners can cover up anything that can’t be cleaned, giving you a fresh start in the space. A textured liner also helps to keep drawer organizers in place, so they don’t slide around each time you open and close the drawer.RAE DUNNCalifornia artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.\"Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design, and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3TKoioIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B09QLMJN13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QLMJN13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QLMJN13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
