window.products.push({"id":1001353,"name":"Snowfolks Stemware Collection, Winter Blizzard Thrilling Sled Ride for 3 Cute and Funny Snowmen, 20 Ounce Large, Unique Painted Wine Glass Design Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81he5+N1lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our colorful hand painted glassware collection with festive snowmen remind us of simple joys of the holiday season. Our line of collectable Snowfolks Wine Glasses are designed by Deedee, the artist for SincerleyChic. She has quite a knack for bringing these fun loving snowman to life with their animated expressions and adorable personalities. These are truly special Glass Stemware, each has a unique story to share through a variety of exciting adventures while others are busy spreading Christmas cheer. They're always the life of the party and a great way to enjoy the winter season. Our beautiful blue gift boxes make these perfect for sharing with your best friends and wonderful family. Each and every one includes something you may not have first noticed; a precarious character called Little Bertie. Our Bertie bird seems to get caught in the action of every scene somehow or another. You’ll have fun looking for her on every glass in our collectible edition. This particular design has decorative snowflakes are all around this cobalt blue glassware as three fun-loving Snow Folks endure a downhill thrill. You can't hear the wind howling but you sure can see it swirling around the playful bunch. This winter sled ride brings to light memories of outdoor pleasures from times gone by. This glass is perfect to mix and match with our other colors and designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81he5+N1lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SincerelyChic™","source_asin":"B00IXW8RHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IXW8RHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IXW8RHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
