window.products.push({"id":1001412,"name":"DSCD Bag Sealer, Portable Mini Bag Sealer Heat Seal, 2 in 1 Food Sealer and Cutter, Handheld Sealer Machines Chips Bag Resealer for Plastic Bags Chips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ePEK3j2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Use Handheld Portable Bag Heat Vacuum Resealer? Are you still worried about wasting large bags of snacks, chips, dried fruit, candy, cereal that you can't finish? This 2-in-1 mini bag sealer helps you store leftover food, snacks, fruits, etc. in the original bag. It avoids waste and keeps the food fresh and tasty at the same time. The mini bag heat sealer is suitable for sealing polyester film bags, vacuum food bags, cookie bags, paper rollers, potato chip bags, plastic bags, press fit packaging, small plastic bags, aluminum foil bags and PVC bags, not for paper bags, ultra-thin cling film bags and non-hot melt bags. Chip bag heat sealer is a mini size, easy to carry, perfect for camping, hiking and picnics, with hook function, can easily hang in the kitchen, with a magnetic patch on the back can be attached to the refrigerator. 【How to use】 1.open the protective cover, push up the battery compartment with two AA batteries (not included), installation attention to the positive and negative poles. 2.the protective cover will slide backwards.  3.place the bag between the top cover and the heating plate, align the sealing line. 4. press the top cover, handheld pull bag sealing machine, can be repeated several times to seal, better results. 【Warm tips】 1) Do not use more than 3 minutes per heating, and use at an interval of 3-5 minutes after each use. 2) The moving speed of sealing depends on the thickness of the plastic bag, the thinner the faster the sealing, otherwise it is easy to break. Thicker to seal slowly, or not seal. 3) Please scrape off the residue on the heating jacket to get a better seal. 4) Please keep away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ePEK3j2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DSCD","source_asin":"B098QS1FX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098QS1FX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098QS1FX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
