window.products.push({"id":1001554,"name":"JE Make IT Simple Automatic Hand Sanitizer Dispenser Wall Mounted (WHITE-1200)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6wBFaEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Infrared Sensor Auto Spray】Our electric soap dispenser is equipped with an infrared sensor, which allows you to dispense soap without pressing any buttons. Simply place your hand 8-12cm below the sensor, and the soap dispenser will automatically dispense soap, allowing for quick and hygienic hand disinfection. By eliminating the need to touch the dispenser, this feature helps prevent cross-contamination 💪【1200ml Large Capacity】Our electric soap dispenser has a large 1200ml capacity, which allows for fewer refills and less frequent disinfection. It is also easy to install and disposable, making it very convenient to use. This dispenser is perfect for a variety of settings such as homes, bathrooms, schools, offices, and recreational centers 💡【Two Power Modes】Our automatic manual sanitizer dispenser supports two power modes: 4 C batteries and a power adapter. This greatly improves the environmental adaptability of the soap dispenser. In wet environments, you can use the battery-powered mode to improve safety. In dry environments, like shopping center aisles, you can use the power adapter mode to eliminate the need to constantly replace batteries. This versatility makes it perfect for a variety of settings 💡【Wall Mounted Liquid Dispenser】Our manual sanitizer dispenser can be easily mounted on the wall with just four screws, providing better stability and saving counter space. Its sleek and modern design will complement any bathroom or kitchen decor, making it perfect for use at home, in offices, schools, or public restrooms 💡【Crystal Clear Dispensing Experience】Our hand sanitizer dispenser is designed for use with various types of liquids including hand sanitizer, soap, and foam. The transparent container allows for easy monitoring of liquid levels and ensures that you always have enough on hand. Plus, with its versatile design, it can accommodate the needs of both children and adults, making it suitable for use in any household","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6wBFaEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JE Make IT Simple","source_asin":"B0891544RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0891544RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0891544RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
