window.products.push({"id":1001636,"name":"rabbitgoo Privacy Window Film, 3D Decorative Frosted Glass Coverings 35.4\"x78.7\", UV Sun Blocking Window Clings, Static Cling Door Glass Stickers, Win","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VN4bcwcNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Super Privacy, Enjoyable Natural Light: The best option to strong curtains and blinds in summer! With a great privacy level, this private window film effectively blocks unwanted outdoor views, perfectly protects privacy even for bedroom and bathroom, ensuring that your private space is well secured. Meanwhile, it helps to soften strong sunlight and still allows natural sunlight through Gorgeous Patterns, Stylish Decoration: With special peony flower patterns, this window film creates an attractive look and high-end texture on your home and office windows, a great alternative to heavy blinds or curtains if you want decoration like that! Static Cling, No Annoying Glue Hassle: The window film is applied by static cling without any harmful and sticky glues or adhesives, super easy to install on flat, clean, and smooth glass surfaces, and can be easily removed and reused according to your need, an optimal and economic option for home applications Strong Sunlight Blocked, Harmful UV Rejected: Direct Sunlight hurts a lot! This window glass film effectively filters strong dazzling sunlight glares, blocks out 84% UVA rays and 99% UVB rays, which helps to reduce the fading of furniture and protect your skin, making your home comfortable to live in Comes Easy, Looks Great: The glass film is perfect for any DIY project on home decoration at a minimum cost; It is super convenient to install with some water and a squeegee or a towel, you could easily put this beautiful window cover up on the window in several minutes. But please remember to separate the backing film from the patterned front before application","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VN4bcwcNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rabbitgoo","source_asin":"B08H5CSRSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5CSRSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H5CSRSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1001637,"name":"GURO Cast Iron Enamel Coated Dome Casserole Dutch Oven, 4.7QT / 4.5L (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhjgmmXkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Before cooking: - Carefully wash and dry the cookware. - If you are cooking on an electric/glass/ceramic stove, always lift the cookware to change its position in order to prevent scratching the stove-top. - Stacking, dropping and bumping your enamel-coated cookware can cause chipping on the surface. - Placing metallic objects inside your microwave is a recipe for disaster. Use your oven instead, and make sure not to exceed 500°F. - Cooking outdoors? Perhaps not the best idea if your cookware is enamel coated. Avoid using it in campfires and outdoor grills to avoid discoloration of the enamel. - Acidic foods may stain or discolor the enamel, however, this does not harm or change the quality of the cookware. Maintenance & Care - Many cooking techniques require stirring the food. Make sure to use non-metallic utensils to prevent scratches on the inside enamel layer of your cookware. - Once you are done cooking let your cast iron cool down before washing it. Then, although dishwasher safe, it is better to use soap and warm water to clean it thoroughly. Avoid using any form of citrus cleaners. - Dry the cast iron by either using a towel or by warming it up to vaporize the remaining water from the surface. - Avoid drastic temperature changes over short periods of time to prevent fracture in your cookware. Make sure to warm it up and cool it down gradually. - Your Guro cast iron product is an energy saver; use a low flame until the required temperature is achieved. - Gaining some tough stains? Try rubbing them off using baking soda and a cloth. Still not coming off? Bleach should be able to eliminate anything else.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhjgmmXkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GURO","source_asin":"B078JZWKJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JZWKJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JZWKJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
