window.products.push({"id":1001693,"name":"Pulada LED Imitate Pseudo Glow Tube Clock,7 Bit RGB Digital Clock Time Display,DIY Nixie Tube Clock Simulation, PIR Motion Control,12 and 24 Hours Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FC6i33wuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: - 16 million colors to adjust - LED pseudo glow tubes have long life - Simple assembly, cool mode - Micro-USB port - Acrylic digital films - Accurate timing - Multiple display modes - Stable-performance chip - Retro classic look - Five brightness levels - Designed with a button battery. It will remember the time when power-off - Seven wonderful display modes - Easy to assemble: most of the main body has been pre-assembled, just assemble acrylic digital films and it takes about 30 minutes. - Simple operation: easy to use. Equipped with time, mode and brightness buttons. USB direct charge power supply, can be powered by a computer, socket or power bank. Seven Cool Display Modes: 1. Custom color display mode: The default is orange monochrome display. You can set the same or different colors for each group of numbers. 2. Rainbow gradient mode: The colors of three groups of time numbers fade together. 3. Breathing display mode: Three sets of time numbers become brighter/faded. 4. Flowing water gradient mode: The color of time number is displayed gradually from left to right. 5. Time beating display mode: Three groups of time numbers are randomly beating and then frozen on the time display. 6. Time digital carry animation setting: Animation, still or jump when time digital carry. 7. Test mode: All numbers are displayed from 0-9, to detect whether digital films are installed successfully or not. Package Included: - 1 x Set of Pseudo Glow Tube Clock","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FC6i33wuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pulada","source_asin":"B095XSXY2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095XSXY2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095XSXY2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
