window.products.push({"id":1001799,"name":"evron Spill Proof Travel Mug with Anti-Leak Locking Lid, Insulated Double-Wall Coffee Mugs for Hot and Cold Drinks (16oz and 10oz 2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KwWmk5x5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double-layer Insulated travel cup, it never burns your hand when the cup is loaded with freshly brewed coffee since the outer wall only has the temperature of about 104°F (40°C), and the body surface temperature of the palm is around 89°F(32°C), so it will not be hot, cold winter can also be used to warm hands also. Best travel companion features double-wall insulation that helps keeps drinks hot or cold for 3 hours, for optimal result, best to serve hot within 3 hours Since the cup body is not made by stainless steel, it could not keep hot/cool for 24 hours. Evron is a kind spill proof reusable coffee mug. Easy to hold，Ergonomic and stylishly designed for modern commuters, travelers and urban explorers of today's fascinating world. Whether you are driving a car, catching a train or riding on a bus, this coffee cup is the ultimate companion that will make your day brighter, able to hold up to 16 ounces. Note: Evron Cup can be used in microwave oven and safe to dishwasher, microwave oven temperature should not be exceed 220~275℃, removed the cup cover while heating, but it is not recommended to place in the microwave for a long time! Precautions before use: 1. Check that the inner ring seal of the cup cover is properly installed, 2. The cup cover should be scurried against leakage .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KwWmk5x5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"evron","source_asin":"B09B983MWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B983MWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B983MWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1001800,"name":"Mini Multicolor Christmas Ball Ornaments Small Vintage Ball Ornaments for Christmas Tree Plastic Ball for Seasonal Decor Party Holiday Indoor Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c116L49-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Different matches in colors: The 5 colors of decorative ornaments can be combined into different matches, colorful and charming to decorate your Christmas tree and house, which will make your festival full of bright and harmonious visual enjoyment.  Assorted using occasions: These holiday ornaments can be applied to Christmas, graduation ceremonies, birthday parties, baby shower, and more, and you can hang them on the tree, door, ceiling, stairway, and other places to make better decorating effects.  Specifications: Material: plastic Color: gold, silver, red, green, blue Size: approx. 1.5 cm/ 0.59 inches  Package includes: 160 x Christmas tree decorations  Notes: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The color may exist a slight difference due to different screen displays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c116L49-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kathfly","source_asin":"B0BGSD6PFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSD6PFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSD6PFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1001801,"name":"SMART by Simple Memory Art Pi Shower Curtain - EVA Vinyl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tl1qOosrL._AC_.jpg","description":"What is Pi? Is it the ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter or a mathematical constant throughout the universe? Or both? Containing over 4,600 numbers of Pi, our SMART Pi Shower Curtain is the logical choice for a transcendental bathroom. SMART shower curtains bring fun and easy learning experiences into your home through environmentally conscious products. Most of life's basic knowledge is discovered at an early age and usually forgotten by the time we're adults. Amazingly enough we call have a natural curiosity that allows us to continually absorb everything around us. So what's the easiest way to learn and remember something? See it over and over again. And where do you spend a lot of time everyday? In the bathroom! Whether you're brushing your teeth or jumping into the tub you're bound to look at these SMART shower curtains and have fun soaking up from cools facts without even trying. We're certain that you will enjoy using these shower curtains! 71\" x 71\". Gift messages may also be included on packing list.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tl1qOosrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMART by Simple Memory Art","source_asin":"B00326I8WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00326I8WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00326I8WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1001802,"name":"Hagen Renaker Chihuahua Mama Brown (00035) and Pup (03381), Hand-crafted Miniature Ceramics","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417BTAALywL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hand-crafted in the USA since the 1940s. High-quality collectible figurines that do not lose value (unless you break them). John and Maxine Renaker started Hagen-Renaker in their garage in Culver City in the latter part of 1945. John Renaker set up the first kiln by running a garden hose from the family's gas stove. Maxine Renaker was the first designer and salesperson. After successfully selling their first pieces, they found they could not produce them. John Renaker's Mom, Moss Renaker, worked for a pottery in Monrovia called Walker Potteries. Her boss, Joe Walker, agreed to teach John about the pottery business. Maxine's Dad, Ole Hagen, built the couple their first factory. Ole who was a carpenter by trade, went to Oregon to get a load of lumber at wholesale cost, and he and his brother, Arne worked every weekend for months to build a combination factory and apartment. In gratitude, John and Maxine named their new company Hagen-Renaker. On Easter Sunday, 1946, the family and their fledgling company moved to Monrovia. The company first produced elaborately decorated plates and butter pats and shadow boxes. They were selling well, but there were difficulties with them related to firing and shipping. John Renaker noticed a small duck that Maxine had on her work bench. She was a Camp Fire Girl leader and had designed it for the kids. He saw potential in it and put it on the bottom of the company's order sheet. When he saw how it sold, he decided to change direction and produce small figurines. Soon they transformed Helen Perrin from a decorator into a designer, and she was joined by others. John and Maxine recognized artistic excellence and based their business on these talented designers. This tradition continues today. Maureen Love Calvert and Helen Perrin Farnlund are still providing a majority of the new items to the line and have been joined by Bob McGuinness and Kathleen Ellis. (Most of text is from the official Hagen-Renaker website.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417BTAALywL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hagen Renkaer","source_asin":"B00QPJYUGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QPJYUGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QPJYUGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
