window.products.push({"id":1001896,"name":"DR.DUDU 24 Pack Christmas Glitter Red Berries Stems for Christmas Tree Decoration, 8\" Artificial Christmas Golden Red Berry for DIY Crafts Wreath Garl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uhgZ2bIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great decoration - The round shape of Glitter Red Berries can pass happy atmosphere to everyone, which is important when people celebrate Christmas Eve. The glitter of golden red berries and the green of Christmas tree supplement each other, making the Christmas tree more noble and solemn. Putting a bunch of golden red berries at home will bring much more festival atmosphere. Great material - The wire of the glitter red berries stems is made of premium mental, which makes it strong enough to stand still when put into other places. The tip of the wire is grind and smooth so that people won't get hurt. The glitter outside the red berries is safe and non-toxic, too. But do remember to warn your kids not to poke the wire into eyes or eat it. Premium quality - The Christmas glitter red berries set is made of foam material, which is durable, tasteless and safe. The foam is tight, firm and complete so that there will be none of foam debris scattering on the floor. The wire that supports all the golden red berries is thin but strong, is sharp but safe. The glitter on the surface is beautiful and safe. If there is some glitter dropping, it is a normal phenomenon. Made for Christmas - The combination of red berries and a Christmas tree is one of the most popular and classic combinations at Christmas. Every family will obey this rule to decorate the Christmas tree. The origin of red berries has a nickname called \"Christmas tree\" that echoes with the Christmas tree itself. The round shape of golden red berries is just like the completely filled berries on the branches. The outside glitter adds some nobleness. Multiple uses - The Christmas Glitter Red Berries Stems can be set at the Christmas tree as the decoration. We have offered 24 golden red berries in one set of products for convenience of decorating. Decorating each place with one glitter red berries or putting several glitter red berries into a vase is also a good idea. You can DIY your Christmas decorations with our Christmas Glitter Red Berries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uhgZ2bIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DR.DUDU","source_asin":"B08FFTG7P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1001896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FFTG7P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FFTG7P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
